            <expandOthers>false</expandOthers>
            <footer>Shows opportunities in Develop and Design stages with activity in the last 30 days, where activity is defined as a change in Decision Date, Stage, Opportunity Value ($), Volume, Description or Status. Goal for 2016 is 65%.</footer>
